      en: ["The National University of Córdoba was founded by the Jesuits in 1613.", "The site was officially listed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2000.", "The Church of the Society of Jesus was constructed between 1640 and 1676.", "The church's vault is made of cedar wood and resembles a ship's hull.", "The Jesuits were expelled from the Spanish Empire in 1767 by royal decree.", "The complex covers a full city block in the historical center of Córdoba."],
