      en: ["Construction on the palace started in 1897 and lasted until 1946.", "The central dome rises to 80 meters and is covered in weathered bronze.", "The building was formally inaugurated on May 12, 1906.", "Architect Vittorio Meano's design was inspired by the Pantheon in Rome.", "The facade is primarily constructed from white marble and granite.", "The Senate Library is famous for its hand-carved walnut wood paneling."],
